lgorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 13.4.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"347"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"367"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"omitted-in-supplied-draft"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)\\)</span>，为通用前缀自由机器，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_U\">\\(\\Omega_U\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2e51855b95e81cff\" href=\"?note=2e51855b95e81cff\" title=\"43-df-omega\">43-df-omega</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\gamma\\in\\mathcal L\">\\(\\alpha,\\gamma\\in\\mathcal L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_S\">\\(&lt;_S\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a4894b7383014259\" href=\"?note=a4894b7383014259\" title=\"43-df-solovay-degree\">43-df-solovay-degree</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\gamma&lt;_S\\alpha\\land\\alpha&lt;_S\\Omega_U\\implies\\exists\\beta_0,\\beta_1\\in\\mathcal L\\;\\left(\\beta_0+\\beta_1=\\alpha\\land\\bigwedge_{i\\in\\{0,1\\}}\\left(\\gamma&lt;_S\\beta_i\\land\\beta_i&lt;_S\\alpha\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\gamma&lt;_S\\alpha\\land\\alpha&lt;_S\\Omega_U\\implies\\exists\\beta_0,\\beta_1\\in\\mathcal L\\;\\left(\\beta_0+\\beta_1=\\alpha\\land\\bigwedge_{i\\in\\{0,1\\}}\\left(\\gamma&lt;_S\\beta_i\\land\\beta_i&lt;_S\\alpha\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留严格不完全性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;_S\\Omega_U\">\\(\\alpha&lt;_S\\Omega_U\\)</span>，不把该分解推广到最高度；未额外断言两个分量互不可比。所给草稿在此定理之后直接写 DELETED PROOF，故本轮只核对陈述，不能把缺失证明写为已检查。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 13.4.5；印刷页 347，PDF 页 367。本轮核对范围及证明限制如上。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-solovay-degree","status":"resolved","id":"a4894b7383014259","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-solovay-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"2e51855b95e81cff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"2e51855b95e81cff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U$ 满足 $\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)$，为通用前缀自由机器，$\\Omega_U$ 采用 [[43-df-omega]]；$\\alpha,\\gamma\\in\\mathcal L$，$\\mathcal L$ 与 $<_S$ 采用 [[43-df-solovay-degree]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-solovay-degree","status":"resolved","id":"a4894b7383014259","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U$ 满足 $\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)$，为通用前缀自由机器，$\\Omega_U$ 采用 [[43-df-omega]]；$\\alpha,\\gamma\\in\\mathcal L$，$\\mathcal L$ 与 $<_S$ 采用 [[43-df-solovay-degree]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\gamma\\in\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"<_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma<_S\\alpha\\land\\alpha<_S\\Omega